{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"overall\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"keep\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C2\", \"C4\"],\n  \"cover\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"lean\": [\"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\", \"C2\"],\n  \"plain\": [\"C2\", \"C1\", \"C3\", \"C4\"],\n  \"why\": \"总排：C1与C3文字完全相同，排在最前，因为既保留了迟疑背后的具体原因，也明确表现出这次他已经有所认识；C2更有戏剧性，但略有回到原点的歧义；C4则把这种歧义说得太实。keep：C1/C3最完整地保留了短暂安静、难题重现、这次已知道迟疑缘由，以及舍不得的生活希望；C2次之，C4最容易把他写回最初的茫然。cover：C2的熟悉难题、绕行后的挫败和重新遇见自己，最能解释珠子中的回返感；C1/C3对安静消退和这次已有认识的解释更准确，但回返的形象稍弱；C4的当初式茫然与珠子强调的经历累积不够吻合。lean：C1/C3最直接，两条心理动作各有明确作用；C4次之；C2把难题重现、挫败和重新遇见自己连续说出，有一定重复。plain：C2的绕了这么久还是碰上那个不知怎么办的自己最有个人经历的质感；C1/C3清楚自然，但这回知道自己为什么迟疑稍显解释性；C4的走了这么远和心里很挫败比较概括。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "403f3f0f-52dc-4506-8840-1c8555c0c852", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T005902848819Z", "elapsed_seconds": 34.656, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:59:37.516159+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "88125ca07db4ea6a12aad53e514071ace487a28b1a2ac61eb80c237cac84bdbe", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\cha